WEBVTT

00:01:26.556 --> 00:01:31.476
It's found in the leaves,
flowers and seeds of many plants,

00:01:31.476 --> 00:01:33.436
including silphium,

00:01:33.436 --> 00:01:36.676
which was used for birth control
in the Middle Ages

00:01:36.716 --> 00:01:40.036
and perhaps is the reason why
the heart became associated

00:01:40.036 --> 00:01:42.716
with sex and romantic love.

00:01:43.716 --> 00:01:45.076
Whatever the reason,

00:01:45.116 --> 00:01:50.036
hearts began to appear in paintings
of lovers in the 13th century.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:54.196
Over time, the pictures
came to be colored red,

00:01:54.236 --> 00:01:56.076
the color of blood,

00:01:56.076 --> 00:01:57.476
a symbol of passion.

00:01:57.956 --> 00:01:59.836
In the Roman Catholic Church,

00:01:59.876 --> 00:02:04.196
the heart shape became known
as the Sacred Heart of Jesus.